cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "mg8-engine (MG8 family): A deterministic logic-gated execution engine for composable intelligence units."
authors:
  - given-names: Nicholas C.
    family-names: Hartman
    affiliation: American Milestone Inc
abstract: "Reference runtime for the MG8 file family. A deterministic logic-gated execution engine: gates run in the declared ORK order, a FAIL gate result halts execution (no further gates or operations run; GateFailure raised, trace status HALTED), and every gate attempt and the halt are recorded in an event-level QSON trace. Determinism covers control flow and trace construction, not third-party model outputs."
repository-code: "https://github.com/nhartman000/mg8-engine"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - deterministic AI
  - MG8
  - NYCH
  - high-assurance AI
